msgid "Migration Guide"
msgstr ""

msgid "We just released our second Alpha for Quarkus 2.0."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We had a lot of feedback and Continuous Testing got a lot of fixes and "
"improvements."
msgstr ""

msgid "Please keep the feedback coming!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you have missed our Alpha1 announcement: here are link:/blog/quarkus-2-0-"
"0-alpha1-released/[the main new features of Quarkus 2.0]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We will keep the Migration Guide up to date here: https://github.com/"
"quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-2.0."
msgstr ""

msgid "Documentation"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For now, the documentation for our `main` branch is not available on the "
"website yet.\n"
"It will be available soon."
msgstr ""

msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr ""

msgid "Continuous Testing"
msgstr ""

msgid "The most visible being a far improvement integration in the Dev UI."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Another notable one is the addition of `quarkus.test.type` which can be used "
"to define which tests are run in continuous testing, `unit`, `quarkus-test` "
"or `all`."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full Changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get the full changelogs of https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
